Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1.2 Transmisi\[OAcute]n de Se\[NTilde]ales Nerviosas", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951606064289851*^9, 3.951606090148347*^9}, 
   3.951842375786276*^9, 3.9518431274580746`*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"5c642fc3-5706-464a-a490-46bece680188"],

Cell["\<\
En la transmisi\[OAcute]n de se\[NTilde]ales nerviosas el sistema nervioso es \
el responsable de recibir est\[IAcute]mulos externos (por ejemplo: el tacto) \
y coordinar respuestas. 

Est\[AAcute] compuesto por:
\t1. cerebro: el cual procesa la informaci\[OAcute]n,
\t2. m\[EAcute]dula espinal: que transmite se\[NTilde]ales entre el cerebro y \
el cuerpo, y los
\t3. nervios: conectando los \[OAcute]rganos y m\[UAcute]sculos con el \
sistema central.

Un ejemplo pr\[AAcute]ctico para entender el funcionamiento del sistema \
nervioso es cuando se toca algo caliente, los nervios de la mano \
env\[IAcute]an una se\[NTilde]al al cerebro, que responde ordenando retirarla \
mediante una se\[NTilde]al motora. El sistema nervioso consume el 25% de la \
energ\[IAcute]a corporal diaria.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9500916235385323`*^9, 3.95009168546673*^9}, 
   3.9500918011134014`*^9, {3.9500918829752903`*^9, 3.9500918953358135`*^9}, {
   3.9500920495534725`*^9, 3.950092173865423*^9}, {3.9500922993769855`*^9, 
   3.9500923159839325`*^9}, {3.9515876309058857`*^9, 3.951587633249505*^9}, {
   3.95158775577759*^9, 3.951587756969208*^9}, {3.951587912420541*^9, 
   3.951587912624371*^9}, 3.951589019079994*^9, {3.9515891568292294`*^9, 
   3.9515891811642027`*^9}, {3.951589429474701*^9, 3.951589592345694*^9}, {
   3.951658369406765*^9, 3.951658370769384*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.88, 1, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"921057e1-a574-4586-85d2-bdc2d16a26bf"],

Cell["\<\
Un nervio t\[IAcute]pico consiste en un haz de celdas nerviosas llamadas \
neuronas, dispuestas de manera parecida a como los alambres \
telef\[OAcute]nicos se agrupa en un solo cable. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9500916235385323`*^9, 3.95009168546673*^9}, 
   3.9500918011134014`*^9, {3.9500918829752903`*^9, 3.9500918953358135`*^9}, {
   3.9500920495534725`*^9, 3.950092173865423*^9}, {3.9500922993769855`*^9, 
   3.9500923159839325`*^9}, {3.9515876309058857`*^9, 3.951587633249505*^9}, {
   3.95158775577759*^9, 3.951587756969208*^9}, {3.951587912420541*^9, 
   3.951587912624371*^9}, 3.951589019079994*^9, {3.9515891568292294`*^9, 
   3.9515891811642027`*^9}, {3.951589429474701*^9, 3.951589592345694*^9}, 
   3.951589629288389*^9, {3.9515896596600323`*^9, 3.9515898122197866`*^9}, {
   3.951589864733096*^9, 3.9515898799359913`*^9}, {3.951592476223733*^9, 
   3.951592477323649*^9}, {3.9515946812671137`*^9, 3.9515947020267057`*^9}, 
   3.9515968126857862`*^9, {3.951596847521831*^9, 3.951596915076144*^9}, {
   3.9516513589777737`*^9, 3.951651359850347*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.88, 1, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"d68c2aa6-6a52-4693-b496-891ea3c83afb"],

