Cell["\<\
El estado de reposo de una celda se entiende como el estado en que no esta \
recibiendo ni transmitiendo ninguna se\[NTilde]al el\[EAcute]ctrica, y por lo \
tanto mantiene su polarizaci\[OAcute]n y su potencial de reposo. El valor t\
\[IAcute]pico del potencial de reposo para las neuronas en el ax\[OAcute]n es \
de -70 mV donde en el interior es negativo y el exterior positivo.

La distribuci\[OAcute]n i\[OAcute]nica en reposo es:
\t1. Exterior: alta concentraci\[OAcute]n de iones de Na\:207a y Cl\:207b.
\t2. Interior: alta concentraci\[OAcute]n de K\:207a y prote\[IAcute]nas \
negativas (A\:207b).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9500916235385323`*^9, 3.95009168546673*^9}, 
   3.9500918011134014`*^9, {3.9500918829752903`*^9, 3.9500918953358135`*^9}, {
   3.9500920495534725`*^9, 3.950092173865423*^9}, {3.9500922993769855`*^9, 
   3.9500923159839325`*^9}, {3.9515876309058857`*^9, 3.951587633249505*^9}, {
   3.95158775577759*^9, 3.951587756969208*^9}, {3.951587912420541*^9, 
   3.951587912624371*^9}, 3.951589019079994*^9, {3.9515891568292294`*^9, 
   3.9515891811642027`*^9}, {3.951589429474701*^9, 3.951589592345694*^9}, 
   3.951589629288389*^9, {3.9515923409721413`*^9, 3.9515923590490026`*^9}, {
   3.951597523168198*^9, 3.951597621652507*^9}, {3.951597654041847*^9, 
   3.9515976544241056`*^9}, {3.9515981215531054`*^9, 3.951598153582678*^9}, 
   3.951606137854686*^9, {3.9516062005283957`*^9, 3.9516062243716183`*^9}, {
   3.951606716446329*^9, 3.9516069382494593`*^9}, {3.9516562928578787`*^9, 
   3.9516564889060163`*^9}, {3.951657014110763*^9, 3.951657026050351*^9}, {
   3.951657967700656*^9, 3.9516580192345324`*^9}},
